% INVALID certificate (test of the checker): x in [1,2] is feasible. The multipliers 1/-1 (= -1) and -1/-1 (= 1)
% have the wrong signs for a >= combination, but GMP's sign test only looks at the numerator of a
% non-canonical rational. A sound checker must canonicalize them and reject D1.
VER 1.1
VAR 1
x
INT 0
OBJ min
0
CON 2 0
C1 G 1 1 0 1
C2 L 2 1 0 1
RTP infeas
SOL 0
DER 1
D1 G 1 0 { lin 2 0 1/-1 1 -1/-1 } -1
